1
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,900
Hello! Long time never talk! You really
don't remember me?

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,700
Who is this?

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,800
Aiyoh, cannot recognise?

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Ah... David?

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,800
Yes lah! I changed number.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,500
Eaten already? How is your family?

7
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,450
First, they build trust. Money comes
later.

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,400
Early investment allocation. Five thousand
today; good returns.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,300
That's a lot.

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:35,100
I invested too. I remembered you. Must be
today.

11
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,100
For a moment, hope becomes stronger than
doubt.

12
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:41,750
Don't miss it. Transfer first.

13
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:49,350
Three thousand to release funds.

14
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:50,450
Another payment?

15
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,150
Or we lose five thousand.

16
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:56,050
Money sent makes walking away harder.

17
00:01:06,850 --> 00:01:08,850
David, the investment?

18
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:10,050
What investment?

19
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:11,450
You called me...

20
00:01:11,550 --> 00:01:13,550
I never called you.

21
00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:20,450
Years to save. Minutes to lose.

22
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:37,950
The scam did not begin when she
transferred the money.

23
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:39,350
It began here.

24
00:01:39,550 --> 00:01:41,730
One different decision could change
everything.

25
00:01:43,550 --> 00:01:47,700
Hello! Long time never talk! You really
don't remember me?

26
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:49,650
Tell me your name.

27
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:50,950
Cannot remember meh?

28
00:01:51,050 --> 00:01:52,550
I'll call you back.

29
00:01:52,850 --> 00:01:55,750
David, did you call from another number?

30
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:58,350
No. I didn't call you.

31
00:01:58,850 --> 00:02:02,550
She stopped, checked, and verified.

32
00:02:02,850 --> 00:02:06,850
Same call. Same scammer. One different
decision.
